1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 22=

10
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:02,700
- Stop!
- Don't run!

11
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:06,630
Yungui!

12
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:15,110
You...

13
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:17,180
Finally

14
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:19,990
called me by my name.

15
00:01:23,110 --> 00:01:24,950
I like hearing you call me that.

16
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:27,630
It's a shame that from now on,

17
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:30,150
I'll never hear it again.

18
00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:31,710
What are you saying?

19
00:01:32,750 --> 00:01:34,390
We still have so much left to say,

20
00:01:34,470 --> 00:01:36,030
and so much left to do.

21
00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:38,500
Are you going to leave me all alone?

22
00:01:38,670 --> 00:01:40,150
I can't live without you.

23
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:44,390
If... If there is a next life,

24
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:45,670
would you

25
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:46,900
be willing

26
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:48,980
to... To marry me?

27
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:50,620
Why wait for another life?

28
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:52,030
In this life.

29
00:01:52,430 --> 00:01:53,430
I'll marry you in this life.

30
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:54,260
Do you hear me?

31
00:01:56,070 --> 00:01:56,500
Do...

32
00:01:58,300 --> 00:01:59,300
Do you...

33
00:02:00,110 --> 00:02:01,420
Do you really mean that?

34
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:03,590
I do. I really do.

35
00:02:04,310 --> 00:02:05,230
Just hold on.

36
00:02:06,030 --> 00:02:07,180
You're going to get better.

37
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:07,870
I'm begging you.

38
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:08,830
Please hold on.

39
00:02:08,950 --> 00:02:09,750
Trust me.

40
00:02:10,230 --> 00:02:11,540
You're definitely going to get better.

41
00:02:11,830 --> 00:02:12,470
All right.

42
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,930
I heard it with my own ears.

43
00:02:17,510 --> 00:02:19,260
She said she would marry you.

44
00:02:20,180 --> 00:02:21,060
Now,

45
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:24,390
I can finally issue a decree
granting your marriage, can't I?

46
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:40,180
Your Majesty!

47
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:47,980
You two conspired to trick me.

48
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:52,230
Actually...

49
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:56,180
Actually, this was all my idea.

50
00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:59,180
I wanted to know how you truly felt.

51
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:01,420
I want to marry you.

52
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:03,620
Li.

53
00:03:05,630 --> 00:03:07,190
Do you truly wish to marry me?

54
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,770
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi…♪

55
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:25,460
Why... Why are you still staring at me?

56
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:26,350
Hurry up and go after her!

57
00:03:28,740 --> 00:03:29,190
As Your Majesty commands.

58
00:03:31,290 --> 00:03:34,540
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

59
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:37,580
First bow to Heaven and Earth.

60
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:40,530
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

61
00:03:40,670 --> 00:03:43,390
Second bow to the elders.

62
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:47,190
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

63
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,700
Husband and wife, bow to each other.

64
00:03:51,350 --> 00:03:53,300
The ceremony is complete.

65
00:03:57,950 --> 00:03:58,510
Assassins!

66
00:03:58,860 --> 00:03:59,350
Protect His Majesty!

67
00:03:59,350 --> 00:03:59,670
Watch out!

68
00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:04,420
Your Majesty!

69
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:06,540
Your Majesty.

70
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:07,230
Li.

71
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:08,460
Take everyone to the rear courtyard.

72
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:08,950
Hurry!

73
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:09,950
Be careful.

74
00:04:10,110 --> 00:04:10,950
- Go! This way!
- Go!

75
00:04:11,350 --> 00:04:12,420
None of you are leaving.

76
00:04:12,580 --> 00:04:13,350
Are you trying to rebel?

77
00:04:13,540 --> 00:04:14,190
Enough talk!

78
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:37,580
Hurry, follow me!

79
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:40,110
Go!

80
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:47,830
Is everyone all right?

81
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:49,420
Your Majesty, hurry!

82
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:49,980
All right.

83
00:04:50,510 --> 00:04:50,950
Go!

84
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:51,630
Watch out!

85
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:00,980
- Yungui!
- Yungui!

86
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:02,140
Yungui!

87
00:05:06,070 --> 00:05:07,140
The wound is highly poisonous.

88
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:08,740
Yungui.

89
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,190
Hold on.

90
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:11,740
I'll find a way to save you.

91
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:13,340
This time,

92
00:05:14,950 --> 00:05:17,140
I'm afraid this really is goodbye.

93
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,100
Yungui.

94
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,870
I... I don't want you to die.

95
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:22,900
You can't die.

96
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:24,390
You have to hold on.

97
00:05:24,660 --> 00:05:25,260
Do you hear me?

98
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:26,630
Do you hear me?

99
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:29,220
Take... Take my place

100
00:05:30,430 --> 00:05:31,990
and protect His Majesty.

101
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:33,100
No.

102
00:05:33,550 --> 00:05:34,510
I won't promise you that.

103
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:36,070
I can't.

104
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:37,510
You have to live.

105
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:38,310
You'll be all right.

106
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:41,020
Promise me.

107
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:43,660
Promise me.

108
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,340
Please?

109
00:05:47,140 --> 00:05:48,320
Live well.

110
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:49,020
I...

111
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:50,660
Promise me.

112
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:53,390
I promise you.

113
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:55,660
I promise.

114
00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:57,020
You...

115
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,100
Yungui!

116
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:01,100
Yungui!

117
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:02,780
Yungui!

118
00:06:02,780 --> 00:06:03,400
Yungui!

119
00:06:03,950 --> 00:06:04,630
Master!

120
00:06:05,020 --> 00:06:06,190
Master, wake up!

121
00:06:06,190 --> 00:06:08,220
Don't leave me all alone.

122
00:06:11,550 --> 00:06:12,390
Master!

123
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,660
Master!

124
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:15,510
Yungui!

125
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:17,790
Master!

126
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:18,870
Yanzhi.

127
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:19,630
Dear.

128
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:21,070
What... What's wrong?

129
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:21,950
Dear!

130
00:06:22,460 --> 00:06:23,070
Miss Shen.

131
00:06:24,210 --> 00:06:25,240
Eunuch Li, this...

132
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,330
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

133
00:06:26,330 --> 00:06:27,700
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

134
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:28,660
Hold on.

135
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:31,310
We have to save her.

136
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:32,830
Her water broke. The baby is coming.

137
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:33,220
Come on.

138
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:33,900
Come with me.

139
00:06:33,990 --> 00:06:34,510
Miss Shen.

140
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:35,510
Come on.

141
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:35,990
Come on.

142
00:06:37,550 --> 00:06:38,460
It's all right.

143
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:39,950
Hold on.

144
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:51,340
Don't be afraid, Zheng Shu.

145
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:52,100
I'm here.

146
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:52,780
I'm right here.

147
00:06:54,900 --> 00:06:55,550
Good.

148
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:57,900
Good. Very good.

149
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:02,070
Young Master Ju!

150
00:07:03,340 --> 00:07:04,510
Hurry to the pharmacy in the west.

151
00:07:04,580 --> 00:07:05,550
Get one liang of red ginseng,

152
00:07:05,630 --> 00:07:06,460
four qian of donkey-hide gelatin,

153
00:07:06,460 --> 00:07:07,340
three qian of charred angelica,

154
00:07:07,340 --> 00:07:08,340
and two qian of notoginseng powder.

155
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:10,630
Boil three bowls of water
down to one over high heat.

156
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:10,990
Hurry.

157
00:07:11,070 --> 00:07:11,430
All right.

158
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:12,990
Shu.

159
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:13,900
Hold on, Shu.

160
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:14,750
Hurry!

161
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:17,510
Shu.

162
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:18,630
Think of the baby.

163
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:19,630
Listen to me.

164
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:20,510
For the baby,

165
00:07:21,700 --> 00:07:22,460
push.

166
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:24,580
Push!

167
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:27,460
You can do it.

168
00:07:28,070 --> 00:07:28,660
Keep pushing.

169
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:31,700
Good.

170
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:33,300
(Hongyun Gate)

171
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:58,510
Yungui.

172
00:08:01,990 --> 00:08:03,550
You asked me to protect His Majesty.

173
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,750
I swear to devote the rest of my life

174
00:08:05,830 --> 00:08:06,940
to fulfilling what you entrusted to me.

175
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:10,550
Rest easy.

176
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:17,310
But there is one thing

177
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:20,900
I ask you to forgive me for defying you.

178
00:08:22,830 --> 00:08:24,310
I will never forget you.

179
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:28,580
In this life or the next,

180
00:08:31,460 --> 00:08:32,100
never.

181
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:42,660
Raise the coffin.

182
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:51,880
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

183
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:53,990
♪I stand here today♪

184
00:08:54,130 --> 00:08:58,250
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

185
00:08:58,260 --> 00:08:59,140
(On the road ahead,)

186
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:01,580
(through countless storms,)

187
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:04,830
(I will face them all alone.)

188
00:09:06,770 --> 00:09:08,060
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

189
00:09:08,060 --> 00:09:10,460
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

190
00:09:12,180 --> 00:09:16,220
(Three years later)

191
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:21,460
I want you to make a trip to Jiangnan.

192
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,630
(Liu's Apothecary)
Conduct a thorough investigation into Imperial Merchant Liu Xian.

193
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:26,990
(Liu's Apothecary)
That scoundrel exploits his supposed ties to the imperial family

194
00:09:27,660 --> 00:09:29,030
to extort the people.

195
00:09:30,340 --> 00:09:33,190
Wherever he goes,
he bleeds the people dry,

196
00:09:33,190 --> 00:09:34,310
leaving widespread resentment
in his wake.

197
00:09:35,070 --> 00:09:36,190
Until this criminal
is brought to justice,

198
00:09:36,860 --> 00:09:37,500
I

199
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:40,220
cannot face the people of this realm.

200
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:44,030
Anything else?

201
00:09:44,220 --> 00:09:44,790
Don't leave anything out.

202
00:09:53,430 --> 00:09:53,980
Who is it?

203
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:15,370
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

204
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:19,070
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

205
00:10:19,730 --> 00:10:22,550
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

206
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:26,390
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

207
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:30,560
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

208
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:34,190
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

209
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:41,020
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

210
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:48,900
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

211
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:59,250
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

212
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:01,360
♪I stand here today♪

213
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:06,010
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

214
00:11:06,010 --> 00:11:13,500
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

215
00:11:14,140 --> 00:11:15,430
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

216
00:11:15,430 --> 00:11:17,830
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

217
00:11:18,270 --> 00:11:25,120
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
